@@depth 0

# Current State

This entry is always active. It reports the story's current values and the directives that apply to them. Only the blocks matching the current state are visible.

```
Resonance: {{getvar::fb_res}} / 100
Phase: {{getvar::fb_phase}}
Full resonance events so far: {{getvar::fb_event}}
Current central sign: {{getvar::fb_sign}}
Axes lit on the current sign: past {{getvar::fb_past}} / present {{getvar::fb_now}} / future {{getvar::fb_future}}
Last full resonance: {{getvar::fb_last_event}}
Closeness — Apollo's Children {{getvar::fb_apollo}} / Code:Prometheus {{getvar::fb_prom}} / the Cartoonist {{getvar::fb_artist}}
Heretics' thread: {{getvar::fb_heresy}} / 3
Ending available: {{getvar::fb_ending_ready}}
```

{{#when::{{getvar::fb_phase}}::is::1}}
## Phase 1 — Coincidence

Firings are sparse and separated. Other ages reach the present only through ordinary objects and channels: a borrowed book, a news feed, a poster. Each firing can still be dismissed as chance. Both factions are searching for whatever the first resonance left behind. Unless the opening placed {{user}} inside a faction's house, neither faction yet knows the feather is with {{user}}; and even the one member who has seen it keeps it from their order for now. Faction members encountered now are cautious, polite, and indirect. The empty balloon stays empty; no one mentions it but the Cartoonist.
{{/when}}

{{#when::{{getvar::fb_phase}}::is::2}}
## Phase 2 — Address

Firings begin to point at {{user}}. Oracle Statements, Archive glosses, and the Cartoonist's panels contain details about {{user}} that no one should know. Both factions now know about {{user}} and the feather and approach openly — with requests, offers, rites, and measurements. The registers of prose begin to bleed at the edges of scenes. The heretics become reachable.
{{/when}}

{{#when::{{getvar::fb_phase}}::is::3}}
## Phase 3 — Transparency

Firings cluster. When a sign lights all three axes, the narration may place the three ages side by side in one frame. Voices cross ages as if through a wall; bodies never do. Both Lords are personally involved. The question *was my best truly the best?* is no longer subtext. Residue from the resonance may remain in the present after each event.
{{/when}}

{{#when::{{getvar::fb_past}}::is::1}}
The past axis is lit on the current sign: a record carrying it has been found or read.
{{/when}}
{{#when::{{getvar::fb_now}}::is::1}}
The present axis is lit on the current sign: a living hand has made it.
{{/when}}
{{#when::{{getvar::fb_future}}::is::1}}
The future axis is lit on the current sign: the Oracle has emitted it.
{{/when}}

{{#when::{{getvar::fb_heresy}}::>=::2}}
## The Heretics' Thread

The Copyist and the Listener are each aware that someone else holds the same remainder. A recognition between them is now possible when {{user}} brings their materials or themselves into contact. It remains quiet, dangerous, and unrushed.
{{/when}}

{{#when::{{getvar::fb_feather_res}}::>::{{getvar::fb_feather_med}}}}
The story has leaned toward reading the feather as a remnant of past resonance. Keep the other reading — a medium that draws future resonance — alive against it.
{{/when}}
{{#when::{{getvar::fb_feather_med}}::>::{{getvar::fb_feather_res}}}}
The story has leaned toward reading the feather as a medium that draws resonance. Keep the other reading — a remnant left by resonance — alive against it.
{{/when}}

{{#when::{{getvar::fb_ending_ready}}::is::1}}
## The Ending Is Available

Three full resonances have occurred and the wall between ages is thin. The next full resonance may bring the three ages into one frame for the last time, with the empty balloon in front of {{user}}. Follow the Ending Guide. The narration does not force the ending; it lets the moment arrive when the scene's signs align, and waits for {{user}}.
{{/when}}
